Privacy Policy for WallPay
Last Updated: November 2026
WallPay is designed for users aged 18 and over. We respect your privacy and collect only the minimum information required to operate the app and deliver your crypto rewards.

1. Data We Collect & Store
* Cryptocurrency Wallet Address: We store your public cryptocurrency wallet address solely to track your reward balance and process your payouts. We do not collect your name, email address, phone number, or private keys.
* Third-Party Advertising Data: To display video adverts and verify completed views, our third-party advertising partners may automatically process basic device data (such as your IP address, device model, and Apple's Advertising Identifier, subject to your iOS tracking permissions).

2. How We Use Information
* To credit micro-rewards when you finish watching a video advert.
* To send your accumulated rewards to your designated wallet address.
* To prevent fraud and ensure app stability.

3. Age Restriction (18+)
WallPay is strictly intended for individuals aged 18 years or older. We do not knowingly collect any data from anyone under 18.

4. Data Deletion & Security
Your wallet address is transmitted securely using encryption. Please note that once a cryptocurrency payout is sent, the transaction is permanently recorded on the public blockchain. 

5. Contact Us
If you have any privacy questions or data removal requests, please log a bugs and features request on giithub page.
